{% comment %}
  Tungacea — Botanische Dokumentation (Produktseite).

  Rendered from sections/main-product.liquid via:
    {% render 'specimen-passport', product: product, block: block %}

  Everything here is composed from click values. The merchant selects from fixed
  lists and types nothing; this snippet turns those values into sentences, and
  because the values are fixed the sentences exist in every locale.

  A field left empty produces no line at all — no "unknown", no gap.

  Reads (all namespace `custom`):
  - lieferumfang    Auswahl  — what the buyer receives
  - mutterpflanze   Referenz — metaobject `mutterpflanze`
  - vaterpflanze    Referenz — metaobject `mutterpflanze`; nur bei Saemlingen.
                    Gesetzt heisst: zwei Eltern, und es wird nichts abgeleitet.
  - stadium         Auswahl
  - generation      Auswahl
  - blattlaenge_cm  Zahl
  - bewurzelung     Auswahl  — also derives the experience hint
  - zuechter        Referenz — metaobject `person`
  - bezogen_von     Referenz — metaobject `person`
  - specimen_id     Text
  - aufnahmedatum   Datum

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} Product Liquid object (required)
  - block:   {Object} main-product `specimen` block (required)
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign mf = product.metafields.custom

  assign sp_lieferumfang = mf.lieferumfang.value | default: '' | strip
  assign sp_stadium = mf.stadium.value | default: '' | strip
  assign sp_bewurzelung = mf.bewurzelung.value | default: '' | strip
  assign sp_blattlaenge = mf.blattlaenge_cm.value
  comment
    Generation und Zuechter erbt ein Cutting von seiner Mutter. Das ist
    Biologie, keine Eingabe: ein abgeschnittenes Stueck hat zwangslaeufig
    dieselbe Generation und denselben Zuechter wie die Pflanze, von der es
    stammt. Steht am Produkt ein eigener Wert, gilt der — fuer die Faelle,
    in denen die Ableitung nicht stimmt.

    Bei einem Saemling traegt diese Begruendung nicht mehr. Zwei F2-Eltern
    ergeben keine F2, und zwei Zuechter lassen sich nicht zu einem verrechnen.
    Sobald ein zweiter Elternteil eingetragen ist, wird deshalb nichts mehr
    abgeleitet: lieber keine Angabe als die halbe Wahrheit. Ein am Produkt
    eingetragener Wert gilt weiterhin.
  endcomment
  assign mutter = mf.mutterpflanze.value
  assign vater = mf.vaterpflanze.value
  assign hat_zwei = false
  if mutter != blank and vater != blank
    assign hat_zwei = true
  endif

  assign mutter_quelle = mutter
  if hat_zwei
    assign mutter_quelle = blank
  endif

  assign gen_raw = mf.generation.value | default: '' | strip
  if gen_raw == blank and mutter_quelle != blank
    assign gen_raw = mutter_quelle.generation.value | default: '' | strip
  endif
  assign sp_generation = ''
  if gen_raw == 'Species'
    assign sp_generation = gen_raw
  elsif gen_raw == 'Unbekannt'
    assign gen_word = 'products.product.specimen.generation_unknown' | t
    assign sp_generation = 'products.product.specimen.generation_prefixed' | t: value: gen_word
  elsif gen_raw != blank
    assign sp_generation = 'products.product.specimen.generation_prefixed' | t: value: gen_raw
  endif
  assign sp_id = mf.specimen_id.value | default: '' | strip
  assign sp_datum = mf.aufnahmedatum.value

  assign zuechter = mf.zuechter.value
  if zuechter == blank and mutter_quelle != blank
    assign zuechter = mutter_quelle.zuechter.value
  endif
  assign bezogen = mf.bezogen_von.value

  comment
    Lieferumfang decides the lead sentence, but the wording depends on whether a
    mother plant is actually shown further down. Pointing at a plant that is not
    there would be worse than saying nothing, so the kind is noted here and the
    sentence is built once the mother is resolved.

    An explicit case, not a translation key assembled at runtime: every key
    stays verifiable, and the stored values carry umlauts that would not
    survive being turned into a handle.
  endcomment
  assign delivery_kind = ''
  assign thing_word = ''
  case sp_lieferumfang
    when 'Dieses Exemplar'
      assign delivery_kind = 'exact'
      assign thing_word = 'products.product.specimen.thing_exact' | t
    when 'Cutting der Mutterpflanze'
      assign delivery_kind = 'cutting'
      assign thing_word = 'products.product.specimen.thing_cutting' | t
    when 'Sämling aus dieser Kreuzung'
      assign delivery_kind = 'seedling'
      assign thing_word = 'products.product.specimen.thing_seedling' | t
    when 'Gekeimter Samen aus dieser Kreuzung'
      assign delivery_kind = 'seed'
      assign thing_word = 'products.product.specimen.thing_seed' | t
  endcase

  comment
    Ein Samen im Stadium "Samen" ist bereits gekeimt. Das Wort Saemling waere
    hier falsch; die Auswahl am Produkt bleibt "Saemling aus dieser Kreuzung".
  endcomment
  if sp_stadium == 'Samen' and delivery_kind == 'seedling'
    assign delivery_kind = 'seed'
    assign thing_word = 'products.product.specimen.thing_seed' | t
  endif

  comment
    The experience hint is derived, never entered. It therefore cannot be
    forgotten on a product where it matters. Two parts so the opening can be
    set in bold without markup inside a translation string.
  endcomment
  assign rooting_label = ''
  assign hint_title = ''
  assign hint_body = ''
  case sp_bewurzelung
    when 'Unbewurzelt'
      assign rooting_label = 'products.product.specimen.rooting_none' | t
      assign hint_title = 'products.product.specimen.hint_unrooted_title' | t
      assign hint_body = 'products.product.specimen.hint_unrooted_body' | t
    when 'Frisch bewurzelt'
      assign rooting_label = 'products.product.specimen.rooting_fresh' | t
      assign hint_title = 'products.product.specimen.hint_fresh_title' | t
      assign hint_body = 'products.product.specimen.hint_fresh_body' | t
    when 'Gut bewurzelt'
      assign rooting_label = 'products.product.specimen.rooting_established' | t
  endcase

  comment
    Ein gekeimter Samen hat einen eigenen Hinweis, unabhaengig vom Feld
    Bewurzelung. Das Feld bleibt Tungs Sache und steht weiter in der Datenzeile.
  endcomment
  if sp_stadium == 'Samen'
    assign hint_title = 'products.product.specimen.hint_seed_title' | t
    assign hint_body = 'products.product.specimen.hint_seed_body' | t
  endif

  assign stage_label = ''
  case sp_stadium
    when 'Steckling'
      assign stage_label = 'products.product.specimen.stage_cutting' | t
    when 'Samen'
      assign stage_label = 'products.product.specimen.stage_seeds' | t
    when 'Sämling'
      assign stage_label = 'products.product.specimen.stage_seedling' | t
    when 'Jungpflanze'
      assign stage_label = 'products.product.specimen.stage_young' | t
    when 'Etabliert'
      assign stage_label = 'products.product.specimen.stage_established' | t
    when 'Mutterpflanze'
      assign stage_label = 'products.product.specimen.stage_mother' | t
  endcase

  comment
    Specs line: stage, generation, rooting, leaf length. Only the parts that
    exist. Stage and rooting used to exclude each other, which hid the stage on
    every product that had a rooting state — they answer different questions and
    now stand side by side. Leaf count was dropped; it is countable in the
    pictures and was taking a slot from something harder to see.
  endcomment
  assign spec_parts = ''
  if stage_label != blank
    assign spec_parts = spec_parts | append: stage_label | append: '||'
  endif
  if sp_generation != blank
    assign spec_parts = spec_parts | append: sp_generation | append: '||'
  endif
  if rooting_label != blank
    assign spec_parts = spec_parts | append: rooting_label | append: '||'
  endif
  comment
    Mehrere Exemplare in einem Produkt haben nicht dieselbe Blattlaenge. Ist der
    obere Wert gesetzt und wirklich groesser, steht eine Spanne statt einer Zahl.
    Die Spanne wird in denselben Satz gereicht wie die einzelne Zahl — so gibt es
    keinen zweiten Uebersetzungsschluessel, der auseinanderlaufen koennte.
  endcomment
  if sp_blattlaenge != nil
    assign cm_text = sp_blattlaenge
    assign blatt_bis = mf.blattlaenge_bis_cm.value
    if blatt_bis != nil and blatt_bis > sp_blattlaenge
      assign cm_text = sp_blattlaenge | append: '–' | append: blatt_bis
    endif
    assign leaflen = 'products.product.specimen.leaf_length' | t: cm: cm_text
    assign spec_parts = spec_parts | append: leaflen | append: '||'
  endif
  assign spec_list = spec_parts | split: '||'

  comment
    Nur die Namen werden hier aufgeloest. Die Darstellung traegt das Snippet
    specimen-parent, einmal je Elternteil; der Leitsatz unten braucht
    lediglich zu wissen, ob ueberhaupt ein Elternteil gezeigt wird.
  endcomment
  assign mutter_name = ''
  if mutter != blank
    assign mutter_name = mutter.bezeichnung.value | default: '' | strip
  endif
  assign vater_name = ''
  if vater != blank
    assign vater_name = vater.bezeichnung.value | default: '' | strip
  endif
  assign eltern_da = false
  if mutter_name != blank or vater_name != blank
    assign eltern_da = true
  endif

  comment
    The lead sentence, now that it is known whether a mother plant is shown.
    The old wording said a cutting came from the specimen pictured, which was a
    circle: the gallery shows what is being sold, so a cutting could not come
    from it. It now points at the mother plant, and only when there is one to
    point at.
  endcomment
  assign lead = ''
  case delivery_kind
    when 'exact'
      assign lead = 'products.product.specimen.delivery_exact' | t
    when 'cutting'
      if mutter_name != blank
        assign lead = 'products.product.specimen.delivery_cutting_mother' | t
      else
        assign lead = 'products.product.specimen.delivery_cutting_plain' | t
      endif
    when 'seedling'
      if eltern_da
        assign lead = 'products.product.specimen.delivery_seedling_cross' | t
      else
        assign lead = 'products.product.specimen.delivery_seedling_plain' | t
      endif
    when 'seed'
      if eltern_da
        assign lead = 'products.product.specimen.delivery_seed_cross' | t
      else
        assign lead = 'products.product.specimen.delivery_seed_plain' | t
      endif
  endcase

  assign zuechter_name = ''
  if zuechter != blank
    assign zuechter_name = zuechter.name.value | default: '' | strip
  endif
  comment
    Das Land steht an der Person, nicht an der Pflanze. In Tungs altem Archiv
    trug jeder Zuechter ueber alle Karten hinweg denselben Wert — Tofusprinkles
    zweimal USA. Einmal eingetragen, gilt es fuer jede Pflanze dieser Herkunft.
  endcomment
  assign zuechter_land = ''
  if zuechter != blank
    assign zuechter_land = zuechter.land.value | default: '' | strip
  endif

  assign bezogen_name = ''
  assign bezogen_land = ''
  if bezogen != blank
    assign bezogen_name = bezogen.instagram.value | default: bezogen.name.value | strip
    assign bezogen_land = bezogen.land.value | default: '' | strip
  endif

  assign has_lower = false
  if zuechter_name != blank or bezogen_name != blank or sp_id != blank
    assign has_lower = true
  endif

  comment
    The date format lives in the locale file. A German and an English reader do
    not write the same date the same way, so the pattern is translated too.
  endcomment
  assign datum_fmt = ''
  if sp_datum != nil
    assign date_pattern = 'products.product.specimen.date_format' | t
    assign datum_fmt = sp_datum | date: date_pattern
  endif

  assign has_anything = false
  if lead != blank or spec_list.size > 0 or eltern_da or has_lower
    assign has_anything = true
  endif
-%}

{%- if has_anything -%}
  {{ 'component-specimen-passport.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

  <section
    class="specimen-passport quick-add-hidden"
    aria-labelledby="SpecimenPassport-title-{{ block.id }}"
    {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
  >
    <header class="specimen-passport__header">
      <div class="specimen-passport__heading-group">
        <p class="specimen-passport__eyebrow">{{ 'products.product.specimen.eyebrow' | t }}</p>
        <h2 class="specimen-passport__title" id="SpecimenPassport-title-{{ block.id }}">
          {{- 'products.product.specimen.heading' | t -}}
        </h2>
      </div>
    </header>

    {%- if lead != blank -%}
      <p class="specimen-passport__lead" data-testid="specimen-lead">
        <strong>{{ lead }}</strong>
        {%- if datum_fmt != blank %}
          {{ 'products.product.specimen.photographed_on' | t: date: datum_fmt }}
        {%- endif -%}
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if spec_list.size > 0 -%}
      <p class="specimen-passport__specs" data-testid="specimen-specs">
        {%- for part in spec_list -%}
          {{- part -}}{%- unless forloop.last %} · {% endunless -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      The mother plant follows the lead sentence directly, because that sentence
      points at her: the shorter the way to "shown below", the better it holds.
      The experience hint comes after her — it is a caveat, and a caveat placed
      second makes the whole record read like a warning.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Ein Cutting hat eine Mutterpflanze, ein Saemling zwei Eltern. Es ist
      derselbe Block, ein- oder zweimal gerendert — keine zweite Darstellung
      daneben, die auseinanderlaufen koennte. Die Rolle steuert nur das
      Etikett und die Herkunftszeile.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if hat_zwei -%}
      {%- comment -%}
        Die Kreuzungsschreibweise des Fachs: Mutter × Vater nebeneinander, das
        Zeichen dazwischen. Untereinander gesetzt sah es aus wie zwei getrennte
        Herkuenfte statt wie eine Kreuzung. Das Zeichen ist dekorativ — die
        Etiketten tragen die Bedeutung, auch ohne Bildschirm.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="specimen-passport__cross" data-testid="specimen-cross">
        {%- render 'specimen-parent', eintrag: mutter, rolle: 'mutter', thing_word: thing_word, max_fotos: 1 -%}
        <span class="specimen-passport__cross-sign" aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
        {%- render 'specimen-parent', eintrag: vater, rolle: 'vater', thing_word: thing_word, max_fotos: 1 -%}
      </div>
    {%- else -%}
      {%- if mutter != blank -%}
        {%- render 'specimen-parent', eintrag: mutter, rolle: 'einzeln', thing_word: thing_word -%}
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if vater != blank -%}
        {%- render 'specimen-parent', eintrag: vater, rolle: 'vater', thing_word: thing_word -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if has_lower -%}
      <dl class="specimen-passport__grid">
        {%- if zuechter_name != blank -%}
          <div class="specimen-passport__row">
            <dt class="specimen-passport__label">{{ 'products.product.specimen.breeder' | t }}</dt>
            <dd class="specimen-passport__value" data-testid="specimen-breeder">
              {{- zuechter_name | escape -}}
              {%- if zuechter_land != blank %} <span class="specimen-passport__country">{%- capture tg_land -%}{%- render 'land-name', wert: zuechter_land -%}{%- endcapture -%}({{ tg_land | strip }})</span>{% endif -%}
            </dd>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if bezogen_name != blank -%}
          <div class="specimen-passport__row">
            <dt class="specimen-passport__label">{{ 'products.product.specimen.sourced' | t }}</dt>
            <dd class="specimen-passport__value" data-testid="specimen-sourced">
              {{- bezogen_name | escape -}}
              {%- if bezogen_land != blank %} <span class="specimen-passport__country">{%- capture tg_bez -%}{%- render 'land-name', wert: bezogen_land -%}{%- endcapture -%}({{ tg_bez | strip }})</span>{% endif -%}
            </dd>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if sp_id != blank -%}
          <div class="specimen-passport__row">
            <dt class="specimen-passport__label">{{ 'products.product.specimen.id_label' | t }}</dt>
            <dd class="specimen-passport__value" data-testid="specimen-id">{{ sp_id | escape }}</dd>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </dl>
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- comment -%}
      The experience hint closes the record. Everything above it is what the
      specimen is and where it comes from; this is the one caveat, and a caveat
      belongs after the case it qualifies, not in front of it.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if hint_title != blank -%}
      <p class="specimen-passport__hint" role="note" data-testid="specimen-hint">
        <strong>{{ hint_title }}</strong> {{ hint_body }}
      </p>
    {%- endif -%}
  </section>
{%- endif -%}
